Output proof/captures/settings-open.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1320
Set Height 840
Set Padding 12
Set Framerate 30
Set Theme { "background": "#1e2127", "foreground": "#d7dae0" }
Hide
Type "cd /media/mukund-thiru/SanthData/Santh/worktrees/veyyon-ui-polish && VEYYON_PROFILE=capture bun run dev"
Enter
Sleep 12s
Show
Type "/settings"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "Escape"
Sleep 1s
